=== per-block interrupt-poll cost, in a translated loop (guest EL1) ===
  CNTFRQ_EL0 = 24000000 Hz

  Each section retires exactly 2,000,000 translated x86 instructions
  (1 x86 insn = 4 ARM ops; 40% memory-touching; 8 chained blocks/iteration)

  x86/blk       none    ld+cbnz   hdr-only   cbnz-reg    ld/blk%     hdr% reg/blk%
  5            514us       517us       519us       513us     +0.65%   +0.96%   -0.27%
  10           514us       512us       514us       512us     -0.38%   +0.02%   -0.35%
  20           513us       513us       515us       513us     -0.10%   +0.45%   -0.08%
  40           513us       513us       514us       512us     -0.03%   +0.33%   -0.05%
  80           514us       513us       514us       518us     -0.30%   -0.01%   +0.79%

  per-x86-instruction cost, and per-check cost in ns:
  x86/blk ns/x86insn  ns/ld-check ns/reg-check
  5           0.257        0.008       -0.003
  10          0.257       -0.010       -0.009
  20          0.257       -0.005       -0.004
  40          0.256       -0.003       -0.005
  80          0.257       -0.062        0.162

  drift control (same section run twice, k=5 and k=80):
    k=5  none 514us / 516us   ld+cbnz 517us / 513us  (+0.65% vs -0.54%)
    k=80 none 514us / 513us   ld+cbnz 513us / 514us  (-0.30% vs +0.31%)

=== translated REP MOVSQ: how do you keep it interruptible? ===
  4096 elements x 512 repeats = 2,097,152 8-byte element copies per section
  strategy                            total    ns/elem   overhead worst-case IRQ
  no check (uninterruptible)          655us      0.313      +0.0%      unbounded
  load+cbnz every element             689us      0.329      +5.1%          0.3 ns
  load+cbnz every 8                   808us      0.385     +23.2%          3.1 ns
  load+cbnz every 64                  679us      0.324      +3.6%         20.7 ns
  load+cbnz every 512                 718us      0.342      +9.5%        175.3 ns
  cbnz reg every element              654us      0.312      -0.2%          0.3 ns
  no check (repeat)                   647us      0.309      -1.3%      unbounded

=== EL1 code-cache self-patch and timer-arm costs ===
  bare STR to the code page                          0.46 ns
  STR + DC CVAU + DSB ISH + IC IVAU + DSB + ISB    140.16 ns
  ISB alone                                          8.80 ns
  MRS CNTVCT_EL0                                     0.53 ns
  arm a deadline (MRS CNTVCT + MSR CVAL + CTL)       4.79 ns

  host exits during the whole run: 1
